<title>SPAIN: Viscofan 1996 net attrib 1.39 bln ptas.</title>
<headline>Viscofan 1996 net attrib 1.39 bln ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the full year 1996 for Viscofan in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Pretax profit			    1.29    vs   0.010</p>
<p> Net taxed				  1.39    vs   0.128</p>
<p> Attributable			     1.39    vs   0.128</p>
<p> Turnover				  49.31    vs  46.54</p>
<p> Operating result			 7.62    vs   6.49</p>
<p> Financial expenditures		 2.26    vs   2.24</p>
<p>NOTE - Spanish sausage-casing maker Viscofan said the parent company showed a net profit of 1.92 billion pesetas, up 13.85 percent</p>
</text>
